==Battleground==
*2 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kitarou (Enemy)|Kitarou]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Neko-Musume (Enemy)|Neko-Musume]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

